    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description>Tutanota is the world's most secure email service, easy to use and private by design. Sign up for free encrypted email now.

With end-to-end encryption and 2FA, your emails have never been more secure. The built-in encryption guarantees that your mailbox belongs to you: Nobody can decrypt or read your data.

**Please Note**: This is an automatically updated package. If you find it is out of date by more than a day or two, please contact the maintainer(s) and let them know the package is no longer updating correctly.</description>
    <summary>Tutanota is an email client with a strong focus on security and privacy that lets you encrypt emails on all your devices.</summary>
    <releaseNotes># What's new
 - Extend Inbox Rule Functionality (client able to handle Extended Inbox Rules) [#11201](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11201)
 - Add OLED Dark Theme (Thanks @its-me-kyro) [#11779](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11779)
 - Use ArchiveEnumerationService to get `calculatedSize` for MailDetailsBlob archives to be downloaded for indexing [#11649](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11649)
 - Implement downloading encrypted MailDetails archives natively [#11496](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11496)
 - Search for contacts using more fields [#9170](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/9170)
 - Make ConfigurationDatabase available offline [#11570](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11570)
 - Add exceptions required for tranformation [#11770](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11770)

# Bugfixes
 - TutaSseFacade may attempt to fetch notifications while suspended on desktop [#11723](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11723)
 - Folder does not display any mails when it contains one incoming mail with a `null` MailDetailsBlob [#11703](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11703)
 - Mail indexing fails with single `null` mailDetailsBlob [#11750](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11750)
 - Corrupted drafts stall mail indexing [#11685](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11685)
 - Show more button is not showing when the search list is empty [#11607](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11607)
 - Clearing Cache does not cancel indexing [#11705](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11705)
 - Inconsistent behavior in Trash vs its subfolders [#11571](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11571)
 - Checkbox is not checked when selecting multiple mails in the maillist. [#11709](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11709)
 - Handle deleting range while extending it [#11696](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11696)
 - Adjust the colours of the draft conflict dialogue to conform to the specification [#11616](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11616)
 - Make mail-body a class, not id [#11759](https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/issues/11759)
# Milestone
https://github.com/tutao/tutanota/milestone/460?closed=1


